  "outcome": {
    "ok": true,
    "turn_id": "d09_final_relationship:r2:t1",
    "narration": "Iris stands near one of the empty beds, the sparse F1 floor stretching out around them — bare wardrobes, bare cabinets, two stools tucked at bedside positions. She listens to Nicco's question, and her elbows shift slightly inward toward her sides.\n\n\"That's a fair way to go about it,\" she says. \"Hear someone out before settling a thing. I don't see a fault in it.\" Her posture eases again after a moment. \"If I take issue with something, I'll say so. But asking first — that's better than not.\"\n\nShe glances toward the spiral stair at the perimeter, then back. \"What is it we're deciding?\"",
